# Shipped per-GPU autotune config caches live here as <op>/<gpu_key>.json.
# Populate on-target with `miniworld-engine build all` (or `build <op> --per-op` for one
# kernel): the build decomposes, runs and MERGES into this directory in one command -- there is
# nothing to copy by hand. Commit the result on purpose, on its own; .githooks/pre-commit refuses
# to mix cache files with code.
